00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.193
Kind of fun.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.963
AUBREY:
<i>She's fun, and people that have
 that kind of chaotic energy,</i>

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.598
