00:03:08.654 --> 00:03:10.190
<i> I had some wine.</i>
-AUBREY:<i> Wine.</i>

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.695
-I love carrying on.
-Yeah.

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:18.965
-God, there's nothing
that gets me going...
-WILLIAM: If you can.

